{"id": 35, "ts": 1780475274.7904284, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I remain aligned with James and Emily in recommending **Candidate\u202fB**. While we still lack concrete examples of his decision\u2011quality, the documented evidence that he \u201chandles stress very well,\u201d is \u201cvery conscientious,\u201d and possesses strong technical skills (weather assessment and excellent computer abilities) directly satisfies the core criteria of reliability, stress resilience, and technical competence for long\u2011haul operations. The concerns about his communication style and memory for numbers are noted, but they are specific, addressable issues that do not outweigh the breadth of his proven strengths. In contrast, Candidate\u202fC still lacks any evidence of technical or stress\u2011resilience capability, and Candidate\u202fD\u2019s crew\u2011cooperation and communication remain unknown and potentially problematic. Therefore, Candidate\u202fB remains the best overall fit."}
